    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fatigue; temperature to 37.8 °C at home; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat, clear rhinorrhea, and congestion; no ear pain, facial pain, or trouble swallowing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough; no breathlessness, wheeze, or sputum</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, vomiting, abdominal cramps, or diarrhea; bowel habit unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lower back and pelvic pain worse with coughing; no new injury and no falls</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Right leg burning unchanged; no new weakness or numbness; no bladder or bowel control change</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; sleep broken by cough; no restlessness or anxiety</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>8 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
